  "prefLabel": "Ins 6204.01 Applicability and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 6204.01 Applicability and Scope. Ins 6204 shall apply to all individual and group ancillary health policies and certificates that provide specified disease coverage which are not covered under other rules and are delivered or issued for delivery in this state or renewed on and after the initial effective date of this part.\n\nSource. #13163, eff 1-25-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins6200.html"
